## What enter, or escape, does on the row the cursor is on, said at the
## row's end -- in a conversation, and on a pull request's or an issue's
## page.

copies-the-code = Copies the code
opens-the-file = Opens the file
opens-the-link = Opens the link
closes-it = Closes it
opens-it = Opens it
stops-it = Stops it
# A message that has not been sent yet.
takes-it-back = Takes it back
copies-it-to-the-box = Copies it to the box
opens-in-the-browser = Opens it in your browser
